{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "projlink",
 "version": "0.1",
 "title": "PROJECT LINK: lets mods keep their settings with each project",
 "description": "A helper for other mods: it notes when the Digitakt starts a new project, loads a project, or saves one, and in which slot, so mods can keep their settings with the project (saved when you SAVE PROJECT, back when you load it, defaults for a new one). It does nothing by itself.",
 "category": "System",
 "author": "Cere, made with Claude",
